# Radon runner egress allowlist example.
# Copy to /usr/local/radon-runner/egress-allowlist
# Owner must be root. The runner account must not be able to write it.
# This template names no destination. One rule per line.
# A mode other than log-only is ignored. Blocking is not implemented.
#
# mode log-only
# host <HOST>
# ipv4 <IPV4>
# ipv6 <IPV6>
